DESCRIPTION:Join the Black Mountain Cluster and the Swannanoa-Riceville Cl
 uster for an evening of food\, (non-alcoholic) beverages\, and information
  that will help you restore and preserve Democracy. Hear from candidates f
 or federal\, state\, and local office\, and spend time with like-minded ne
 ighbors from our area. It’s always a fun — and productive — time! Wh
 o should attend: any Democrats and left-leaning unaffiliated voters. The s
 even precincts in Black Mountain are precincts 32.1\, 33.2\, 33.3\, 34.1\,
  35.1\, 36
LOCATION:Lake Tomahawk Park Picnic Pavilion\, 401 Laurel Cir Dr\, Black Mo
 untain\, NC\, 28711
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/961423/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
