 .png
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our weekly sign-waving / protests at the corner of
  Charlotte St. and Chestnut St. Our group hopes to grow every week and enj
 oy the supportive waves and honks from the folks driving past. Bring your 
 signs and your joy. We have extra signs! (For future NAVL protests\, watch
